      "debrief-wing": [
        "Sabra: The families are safe. They've sent you bread, which in this fleet is a medal.\n\nKit: Not bad. You fly a Sunbird like you were born in one. Nobody's born in one, mind.",
        "Sabra: Well flown. Now, Dov has news, and he's been waiting all day to tell it."
