      "briefing-page": [
        "Dov: Years ago a page of the Reckoning was stolen and sold. I've traced it to a wreck in {system}. Three archive pods are drifting there. One of them has the page. Search them all, and gently.\n\nKit: Collectors want the same page. They pay well, and the people they pay shoot well.",
        "Sabra: A page of the Reckoning, lost before I was born, is somewhere in {system}. Search the archive pods and bring it home.\n\nDov: Hold close to each pod. The page won't announce itself."
